Total cost = $18

Profit = Total revenue - Total cost = $36 - $18 = $18

Profit per hour = Profit / Number of hours = $18 / 9 hours = $2 per hour

Therefore, Millie will make a profit of $2 per hour that she spends running the lemonade stand.

