- Total time for Team 1: 220 seconds.
- Total time for Team 2: 222 seconds.
- Difference in time: \( 222 \text{ seconds} - 220 \text{ seconds} = 2 \text{ seconds} \).

Therefore, the faster team will win by 2 seconds.
