   \]

   Subtracting 2 hours from 5:00 pm:
   \[
   5:00 \text{ pm} - 2 \text{ hours} = 3:00 \text{ pm}
   \]

   Subtracting 60 minutes from 3:00 pm:
   \[
   3:00 \text{ pm} - 60 \text{ minutes} = 1:00 \text{ pm}
   \]

